    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you need to make pictures from puzzle pieces. You can choose the type of picture, the shape of the puzzle, the number of elements. The current game is saved and you can continue it at any time. Move the puzzle pieces to the specified field and make a picture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move an element - click on the element and move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the playing field - click on the field and move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in / zoom out the playing field - + / - keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After purchasing, you will be able to put together puzzle pictures in different categories.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you need to make pictures from puzzle pieces. You can choose the type of picture, the shape of the puzzle, the number of elements. The current game is saved and you can continue it at any time. Move the puzzle pieces to the specified field and make a picture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move an element - click on the element and move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the playing field - click on the field and move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in / zoom out the playing field - + / - keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After purchasing, you will be able to put together puzzle pictures in different categories.</p>",
